    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is proud to present 11 Bracken Park Close, an outstanding five-bedroom semi-detached home arranged over three floors and peacefully positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac. This exceptional property offers a rare opportunity for a discerning buyer to acquire a home that balances light, space, and proportion, extending to approximately 215 sq.m/2,314 sq.ft. This Cosgrave built A3 rated home is immaculately presented, having undergone an array of upgrades including the addition of Shalford Interiors kitchen, fitted bespoke entertainment and storage units in the living rooms, designer bathroom upgrades, all meticulously crafted to create a stylish and sophisticated home. \n\nTo the front, there is off-street parking for 2 cars. Well-chosen plants either side of a path lead to the hall door. A bright panelled entrance hall with large guest WC leads to the large family room with custom-made built-in storage and shelving with feature lighting. To the rear of the property is the impressive open plan kitchen/dining/family room with double doors overlooking the low maintenance sunny garden which features a granite patio. The upgraded Shalford design in frame kitchen is the elegant and timeless, comes with handcrafted cabinetry painted deep blues, soft whites, quartz worktops and further complimented by an excellent selection of high-quality integrated appliances and an island which is a focal point of family life and social interaction. The open plan room allows plenty of space for a dining and seated/family area. Off the kitchen lies a good-sized utility, providing extra storage and shelving. On the first floor is the versatile family room that spans the width of the property it also contains a fitted entertainment/storage unit with feature lighting. Also, on this floor there is a second double bedroom and bedroom 5 currently used as an office. There is also a stylish bathroom suite on this floor. On the Second floor lies the principal bedroom that won't disappoint. The main bedroom also has a walk-in dressing room with storage and a newly appointed en-suite. There are 2 further bedrooms on this level both with fitted wardrobes as well as a modern shower room. \nOutside to the rear is the mostly West facing rear garden A granite patio precedes an astro turf lawn which is bordered by flower beds and attractive timber fencing. A Barna shed takes care of home storage needs. A gated side passage lead to the front of the property.\n\nBracken Park offers excellence and versatility in design and detailing. Cosgrave built, with classical good looks, superior comfort and energy efficiency. Bracken boasts a wonderful mature, landscaped setting with communal park and playground surrounded by superb trees and planting, it is situated just off the Carpenterstown Road within a stroll of the Phoenix Park, Castleknock Village and Carpenterstown. There are numerous schools within walking distance as well as excellent public transport links including bus and train (Coolmine train station, 4 stops from the green LUAS line). There are also excellent sports and leisure clubs including golf, football, athletics, tennis etc within easy reach as well as access onto the M50 and onwards to Dublin airport. \n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 7m x 1.2m\nBright and welcoming hallway with attractive wall panelling, wide board laminate timber flooring.\n\nGuest WC - 1.68m x 1.6m\nThis spacious guest wc has matching ceramic and floor tiles, a wash hand basin and wc.\n\nLiving Room - 5.4m x 4.68m\nThis beautifully proportioned room is greatly enhanced by the superb built in storage units with matching shelving and feature underlighting, wide board laminate timber flooring.\n\nKitchen/Dining/Family - 7m x 6m\nLarge open plan kitchen/dining/family room which overlooks the garden and flooded with natural light from the dual skylights, side windows with double glass doors which open to the gorgeous West facing landscaped rear garden and patio. There is a fully fitted designer Shalford Interiors in-frame kitchen with feature matching Island all complimented by Quartz worktops from, there is ample space for families to cook, dine and relax. Feature Smeg range with gas hob and feature canopy. There is also a fitted American style fridge freezer and integrated dishwasher. The open plan room also has extra fitted bench and storage units along the side wall. The room is finished with attractive panelling and fitted radiator cabinets.\n\nUtility Room - 2.7m x 2.27m\nInvaluable for further storage with built in units, plumbed for a washing machine and a dryer. Tiled flooring.\n\n1st Landing - 2.97m x 2.2m\nWith Hot-press.\n\nFamily/Entertainment Room - 6m x 5.4m\nThis excellent sized room is notably bright from 5 windows. It has a radiator cover and the same quality flooring as the living room on the ground floor. Furthermore, it is versatile in its use and is fitted with a entertainment wall with fitted storage and shelving with feature lighting.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.32m x 3.21m\nIs a good size double room overlooking the rear garden with built in wardrobes.\n\nOffice/Bedroom 5 - 3.3m x 2.7m\nWith fitted shelving and work desk, laminate timber flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.53m x 2m\nUpgraded bathroom, comprising of a bath, separate shower, wash hand basin and wc, with matching floor and wall tiles and a chrome radiator\n\n2nd Landing - 2m x 1.5m\n\n\nMain Bedroom - 5.9m x 3.9m\nLarge primary suite located on the top floor\n\nDressing Room - 3m x 2m\nNicely fitted out with a good selection of shelving and hanging space to maximise storage\n\nEn-Suite - 2.2m x 1.65m\nUpgraded en-suite, comprising of a shower, a wash hand basin and a wc, matching tiled flooring and wall tiling\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.37m x 4.2m\nIs a lovely double room with a skylight and a side window, with built-in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.3m x 2.65m\nIs another double room with dual skylights and built-in wardrobes.\n\nShower Room - 2m x 1.52m\nComprising of a wash hand basin, wc and shower with partly tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\n"
      },
